<title>TURKEY: Turkey 189-day t-bill avg yield rises to 135.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Turkey 189-day t-bill avg yield rises to 135.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 189-day t-bill auction of the Turkish treasury on Tuesday produced the following results.</p>
<p>	Maturity		    :March 5, 1997</p>
<p>	Amount			:36.16 trln lira</p>
<p>	Coupon			: -</p>
<p>	Minimum yield	     :124.81</p>
<p>	Maximum yield	     :136.07</p>
<p>	Average yield	     :135.0</p>
<p>	Bid amount/cover	  :85.6 trln</p>
<p>	Lowest accepted price   :64,018 lira</p>
<p>Pct allocated at lowest price: NA</p>
<p>Payment date: August 28, 1996 --Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75 ATA</p>
